# MapStruct Mapping Quality

Mandatory:
- map all required fields (including nested objects)
- treat unmapped warnings intentionally (map or justify ignore)
- keep mapper ownership clear by boundary (DTO-domain vs entity-domain)

When custom mapping is needed:
- document conversion intent for non-trivial transforms
- add tests for complex transforms (enum/date/nested/cycle-sensitive)

Avoid:
- partial mapping that silently drops meaningful data
- giant multipurpose mappers mixing unrelated modules
